### 全件検索
POST http://localhost:8080/noise-record/search?page=0&size=10
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "occurrenceDateFrom": null,
  "occurrenceDateTo": null,
  "occurrenceTimeFrom": null,
  "occurrenceTimeTo": null,
  "durationCategories": [],
  "occurrenceSources": [],
  "noiseLevels": [],
  "soundTypes": []
}

### 音の大きさが3の記録を検索
POST http://localhost:8080/noise-record/search?page=0&size=10
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "occurrenceDateFrom": null,
  "occurrenceDateTo": null,
  "occurrenceTimeFrom": null,
  "occurrenceTimeTo": null,
  "durationCategories": [],
  "occurrenceSources": [],
  "noiseLevels": [3],
  "soundTypes": []
}

### 件数取得
GET http://localhost:8080/noise-record/counts?year=2026&month=11